<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS HOGS $0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS HOGS $0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Trading moderately active. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.75-56.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    54.25-55.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.25-54.25</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    52.25-53.25</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.00-52.25</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs steady to 0.25 higher; 450-500 lbs 1.00 higher; 500-650 lbs steady. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    46.00-46.25</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    47.00-49.00, few 49.50</p>
